## Custom Rule: "WebSocket to Primary"

| Field | Value |
|---|---|
| Condition | `starts_with(http.request.uri.path, "/ws")` |
| Override: Terminates | On |
| Override: Fallback Pool | `ws-primary` |
| Override: Session Affinity | By Cloudflare cookie and Client IP fallback |

All paths starting with `/ws` route exclusively to the primary VPS. This covers both `/ws` (bridge WebSocket) and `/ws/nate-media-stream` (Twilio voice media stream). The clone has no bridge and returns 503 for WebSocket connections.

### Twilio Media Stream path (FIXED Mar 30, 2026)

Twilio `<Stream>` uses **`/ws/nate-media-stream`**. Previously the rule used `eq "/ws"` which did NOT match, causing ~33% of media stream connections to hit the clone VPS (dead air on voice calls). Fixed by changing to `starts_with(http.request.uri.path, "/ws")`.

**Never revert to `eq "/ws"`.** Both `/ws` and `/ws/nate-media-stream` MUST route to the primary.

